- Playerbots config may be built-in or separate file (not found)

### Organization Strategy
Settings grouped by **effect on gameplay**:
- Movement and Combat
- Experience and Progression
- Economy
- Death and Corpse
- Creatures
- Visibility
- Quests
- Instances
- Cross-Faction
- Guilds
- PvP

This makes it easy to find "how do I adjust death penalties?" rather than hunting through alphabetical lists.

