## Lessons Learned

### Documentation as Discovery

Writing the configuration doc revealed:
1. Some settings contradict each other (extended vision + disabled sparkles)
2. Values tuned through iteration (repair cost 25x from trial/error)
3. Cross-faction is core to design (not just convenience)

### Configuration as Design Document

The modified settings tell the story of the game:
- Empty world → no NPCs except spirit healers
- Ambush system → slow movement, high fall damage
- Roguelike → expensive repairs, no rez sickness
- Solo experience → enter instances at any level, solo raids

The config file IS the game design spec.

